                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="https://blog.lecollagiste.com/"
                            class="external-link">Le Collagiste (FR)</a
                        >
                        French blog dedicated to vjing
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a href="https://scanlines.xyz/" class="external-link"
                            >Scanlines</a
                        >
                        Great forum for visualists
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="https://www.shadertoy.com/"
                            class="external-link">ShaderToy</a
                        >
                        Shader/GLSL focused community website with embedded shader
